        "source_row": 38,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7f91da8e",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在冰原上摸索、努力生存的罗伊人并未由此获得安稳的生活，反而迎来了有史以来的第一次虚质磁暴。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 38,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 39,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ad731047",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "根据罗伊古籍记载，那一天强烈的光芒冲破冰层直达天际，人们目之所及的一切都被磁暴吞噬，逐渐失去实体，从这个世界消解。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 39,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 40,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_19e8a4c0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "也就是在这一场灾难中，冰原经历了规模空前的塌陷，罗伊族祖先坠入了巨大的地下空洞中。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 40,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 41,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_6572d6ca",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但在无尽的黑暗中，一颗轰鸣的炉芯却冉冉升起——那是隧者取出自己的炉芯，化作了地下世界的太阳。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 41,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 42,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2f483686",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而关于与隧者大战的▇▇▇▇▇，记载中皆语焉不详，也许比起敌人的可怖，隧者的牺牲更值得罗伊人铭记。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 42,
